WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(audience applauding)

2
00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:04.860
By the way, have you looked up your Uber rating?

3
00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.033
I just did, and I'm a little upset.

4
00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.420
Because I think I'm very nice

5
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.760
to my Uber drivers, beyond nice.

6
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.717
At one point, I even offered to drive.

7
00:00:13.717 --> 00:00:14.978
(everyone laughing)

8
00:00:14.978 --> 00:00:15.811
I'm like the best.

9
00:00:15.811 --> 00:00:16.644
I'm the best person you want.

10
00:00:16.644 --> 00:00:18.040
I don't want music, I don't want anything,

11
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.790
I don't complain, I don't do anything.

12
00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.913
I got a 4.88.

13
00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.370
I rate them five stars, no matter what.

14
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:28.070
Every time?
What am I gonna do?

15
00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.290
What am I gonna ruin somebody's life?

16
00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:31.880
They drive me in a car, I go five, I don't care.

17
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:32.713
Five?

18
00:00:32.713 --> 00:00:33.930
I dunno if I'll ever see you again.

19
00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.650
Five, five, five, I dunno.

20
00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:37.120
What am I gonna give rate people?

21
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.650
Once we start rating people, this is gonna be the disaster

22
00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:42.797
of a society where it's like, "Hi, I'm a 3.5."

23
00:00:42.797 --> 00:00:45.150
"Yeah, I figured."
Well, it turns out

24
00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:46.830
you have a higher rating than I do.

25
00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:48.060
Oh, this is unbelievable,

26
00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.870
but we've been in Ubers together.

27
00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:51.840
Many times and we will be in many more.

28
00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.370
You know, I did some interview about you recently.

29
00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.603
Really?
Yeah and they asked me.

30
00:00:57.470 --> 00:00:59.647
They said, "What's it like meeting Drew Barrymore"

31
00:00:59.647 --> 00:01:00.480
"for the first time?"

32
00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:03.340
"You remember the first time, is she iconic?"

33
00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:05.380
You know, and I said, "Yeah, she is."

34
00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:07.743
I go, "It's like meeting the Statue of Liberty."

35
00:01:07.743 --> 00:01:09.607
(audience laughing)

36
00:01:09.607 --> 00:01:12.577
"And then after a hundred dance parties later,"

37
00:01:12.577 --> 00:01:14.317
"she's still the Statue of Liberty"

38
00:01:14.317 --> 00:01:15.907
"but you just kind of hung out with her,"

39
00:01:15.907 --> 00:01:18.060
"and you got to know who the Statue of Liberty is."

40
00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:19.670
You're the one and only, you're Drew Barrymore.

41
00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:20.503
You're iconic.

42
00:01:20.503 --> 00:01:22.292
(audience applauding)

43
00:01:22.292 --> 00:01:23.211
You're quite the Statue of Liberty.

44
00:01:23.211 --> 00:01:26.399
Yeah, it's something like that.

45
00:01:26.399 --> 00:01:28.810
When people meet you...

46
00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:30.570
People freak out when they meet you.

47
00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:31.960
I've been with you when people meet you.

48
00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:34.717
So, the Uber drivers might freak out and be like...

49
00:01:34.717 --> 00:01:37.160
"How could I give more than five stars, one star."

50
00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:38.330
I don't know what they do.

51
00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:39.800
Look at this.

52
00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:40.895
Yes!

53
00:01:40.895 --> 00:01:44.062
(audience applauding)

54
00:01:45.617 --> 00:01:47.894
This is this how everyone sees you.

55
00:01:47.894 --> 00:01:50.477 line:15%
(upbeat music)

